# Only the per-series subfolders of images/photography/ belong to the site.
# Everything sitting loose in that folder is the raw Wix media dump (~319 MB).
# Ignore the loose files, keep every subfolder (so new series need no edit here).
images/photography/*
!images/photography/*/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Behind-the-scenes camera originals (~128 MB). The site uses images/bts/web/,
# which is built from these by resizing; keep the originals local only.
images/bts/*
!images/bts/web/

# Full-size originals of the two About photos; images/about/ holds the web copies.
images/00022_15A.JPEG
images/DSCF5699.jpg

# Yesterday, Nothing In My Life Changed stills, 4K camera originals. The site
# uses images/stills/ynimlc_stills/web/, built from these by resizing.
images/stills/ynimlc_stills/*
!images/stills/ynimlc_stills/web/

# Poster artwork at print size (4050 x 6000, ~10 MB the pair). The site uses
# images/ynimlc-poster-cropped.jpg, resized from the cropped one.
images/YesterdayNothing_poster_cropped_v4.jpg
images/YesterdayNothing_poster_framed_v4.jpg
images/_compare.png
images/Darlings_poster_v2.jpg
